  "t7mono_citation_english": "By T7a and T7b, for every point named P1, for every point named P2, for every point named P3, for every point named P4, if all of the following hold:\n  (a) P1 matches P2;\n  (b) both P3 matches P4 and P1 ranks below P3, then P2 ranks below P4.\n",
